# ThesisTrack web — build-time environment (spec §18.4 delta, 2026-10-25)
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables are exposed to the browser bundle.
# NEVER put a secret here — anything in this file ships to every visitor.
#
# API origin for SPLIT-ORIGIN deployments (web on Vercel + API on Render).
# Leave unset for same-origin: the Vite dev proxy (apps/web/vite.config.ts)
# and the Docker nginx (apps/web/nginx.conf) both forward `/api` to the API,
# so localhost and the compose stack need no configuration.
#
# On Vercel set it for Production AND Preview environments:
# VITE_API_URL=https://thesistrack-api.onrender.com
#
# The resolved base URL becomes `${VITE_API_URL}/api/v1`.
